 "Outcome": "/dispute-resolution/offline",
 "The award, settlement, or order is issued and delivered to the parties in hard copy.": "/dispute-resolution/offline",
 "Offline proceedings are conducted under the same statutes as online ones — the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, {0}, the Mediation Act, {1}, and the Legal Services Authorities Act, {2} — and under the Adjudix Code of ADR Procedure, {3}. The Offline Procedure Handbook sets out the practical steps.": "/dispute-resolution/offline",
